    "Capability-negotiated addition to native-v1: v1 login/session/nodes/config/traffic/logout are unchanged.",
    "A session binds to exactly one metering source: client_reported (/config + /traffic) or node_reported (grant).",
    "node_reported sessions are billed only from node usage; /traffic is refused with metering_source_mismatch.",
    "Grant credentials are minted by the server per user and per grant; the shared node secret is never delivered.",
